3037:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/x509_crt.c ****  * Verify the certificate validity, with profile, restartable version
3038:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/x509_crt.c ****  *
3039:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/x509_crt.c ****  * This function:
3040:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/x509_crt.c ****  *  - checks the requested CN (if any)
3041:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/x509_crt.c ****  *  - checks the type and size of the EE cert's key,
3042:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/x509_crt.c ****  *    as that isn't done as part of chain building/verification currently
3043:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/x509_crt.c ****  *  - builds and verifies the chain
3044:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/x509_crt.c ****  *  - then calls the callback and merges the flags
3045:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/x509_crt.c ****  *
3046:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/x509_crt.c ****  * The parameters pairs `trust_ca`, `ca_crl` and `f_ca_cb`, `p_ca_cb`
3047:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/x509_crt.c ****  * are mutually exclusive: If `f_ca_cb != NULL`, it will be used by the
3048:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/x509_crt.c ****  * verification routine to search for trusted signers, and CRLs will
3049:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/x509_crt.c ****  * be disabled. Otherwise, `trust_ca` will be used as the static list
3050:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/x509_crt.c ****  * of trusted signers, and `ca_crl` will be use as the static list
3051:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/x509_crt.c ****  * of CRLs.
3052:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/x509_crt.c ****  */
